@startuml
title Spacelords – problemdomän

class SaveSlot {
  number: 1..3
  lastPlayed
}
class SavedGame {
  round
  phase
  exploredSpace
}
SaveSlot "1" o-- "0..1" SavedGame
SavedGame --> Galaxy
SavedGame --> Fleet
SavedGame --> Colony
SavedGame --> Research
SavedGame --> GameEvent

class Galaxy {
  radius
  homePlanet
  mapSnapshot()
}
class StarSystem
class Star {
  name
}
class Planet {
  name
  type: solid | gas
  habitability: 0..100
  buildSlots: 0..10
  deposits: finite resources
  extractionPotential
}
class Colony {
  population
  buildings
}
class Building {
  type
  workers
  constructionCost
  demolition
}
class ConstructionProject {
  type
  reservedCrew
  destinationFleetId
}
class BuildingSite {
  index
}
class Technology {
  researched
}
class Research {
  technologyQueue
  completeSelectedPerYear()
}
class BuildQueue {
  capacity
  moveProject()
  cancelProject()
  completeFirstPerYear()
}
class Ship {
  type
  speed
  crew
}
class Fleet {
  position : HexCoordinate [0..1]
  name
  courseOrigin
  destination
  ships: 0..*
}
class TurnOrder
class GameEvent {
  round
  text
}
note right of GameEvent
  Publiceras när händelsen inträffar.
  Simulering återgår direkt till planering.
end note
class Player {
  name
}
class HexCoordinate <<value object>> {
  q
  r
  neighbors()
  distanceTo()
}

Galaxy "1" o-- "1..*" StarSystem
Galaxy "1" --> "1" Player
StarSystem "1" *-- "1" Star
StarSystem "1" *-- "0..6" Planet
Star --> HexCoordinate : position
Planet --> HexCoordinate : position
Planet "1" *-- "0..1" Colony
Colony --> Player : ownerId
Colony "1" *-- "0..10" BuildingSite
BuildingSite "1" o-- "0..1" Building
BuildingSite "1" o-- "0..1" ConstructionProject : building construction
Building "1" *-- "0..1" BuildQueue : shipyard
BuildQueue "1" o-- "0..*" ConstructionProject : ordered projects
Player "1" *-- "1" Research
Research --> Technology : selects
Technology --> Building : unlocks
Technology --> Technology : prerequisites
Building --> Research : Research station contributes
ConstructionProject --> Fleet : ship recipient
Colony --> Fleet : home fleet
Fleet "1" o-- "0..*" Ship
note right of Fleet
  Tom flotta saknar position.
  Första skeppet bestämmer positionen.
  Sista skeppet släpper positionen.
end note
Ship --> Colony : Colony ship consumed to settle
TurnOrder --> ConstructionProject
TurnOrder --> Fleet
GameEvent --> TurnOrder

note bottom of BuildQueue
  Varje shipyard har egen kö med fem platser.
  Högst ett skepp per fabrik och år.
  Planetens kö färdigställer en byggnad per år.
  Material betalas en gång vid byggstart.
end note

class ResourceDeposit {
  resource
  remaining
}
class PlanetStock {
  resource
  amount
}
class TradeRoute {
  closing
}
class Shipment {
  resource
  amount
  recipient
  path
}
class Decision {
  context
  skippedThisTurn
}
Planet "1" *-- "3" ResourceDeposit
Colony "1" *-- "3" PlanetStock
Building --> ResourceDeposit : extracts
Colony "1" *-- "1" BuildQueue : buildings
TradeRoute "*" --> "2" Planet : endpoints
TradeRoute "0..1" <-- "0..*" Fleet : assigned
Shipment --> Fleet : in transit
Shipment --> PlanetStock : awaiting pickup
Shipment --> ConstructionProject : requested by
Shipment --> TradeRoute : traverses
Player --> Decision
Decision --> Colony
Decision --> Fleet
Decision --> Research
Decision --> TradeRoute
SavedGame --> TradeRoute
SavedGame --> Shipment

note bottom of Galaxy
  Första iterationen använder en fast exempelvärld.
  Kartans läsdata döljer planeter utanför utforskad rymd.
  Skepp utforskar besökta hexagoner; explorers även grannar.
end note

package "Framtida domän – ej implementerad" {
  class AsteroidBelt <<planned>>
  class Civilization <<planned>>
  Fleet --> Civilization : encounter orders
}

note "Kamera, controllers och p5-vyer är tekniska begrepp\noch ingår inte i problemdomänen." as Scope

@enduml
